team/apps/3333760/extras/42a2ebe002323345ca332c4294dd3f4d.poster.avif?t=1752089669\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333760/extras/42a2ebe002323345ca332c4294dd3f4d.webm?t=1752089669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Zero Impact tries to envelop the existential dread of being mediocre in a world full of excellence, where the thing you want to do the most has already been done better than you ever could, in the coat of a linear rhythm-based action adventure with cute angry critters and electronic music.",
